<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-012" chapter-id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin" source-id="s-nanshi-012-wanglingbin-ws2060595">
  <p id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">簡文王皇后諱<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAB">靈賓</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>，齊太尉、南昌文憲公。父<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0030" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAA">騫</persName>，金紫光祿大夫、南昌安侯。后幼而柔明，叔父<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0052" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">暕</persName>見之曰：「吾家女師也。」天監十一年，拜晉安王妃。生哀太子<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0081" ref="rtd_v0b_nyn_A">大器</persName>、南郡王<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0087" ref="rtd_v0b_nyn_C">大連</persName>、長山公主<persName id="c-nanshi-012-wanglingbin:p001:m0094" ref="rtd_v0b_nyn_D">妙挈</persName>。大通三年十月，拜皇太子妃。太清三年三月，薨於永福省，時年四十五。其年，簡文即位，追崇為皇后，諡曰簡。大寶元年九月，葬莊陵。</p>
</text>
